<title>PANAMA: Port conditions update - Panama - Lloyds Shipping.</title>
<headline>Port conditions update - Panama - Lloyds Shipping.</headline>
<text>
<p>Port conditions from Lloyds Shipping Intelligence Service --</p>
<p>PANAMA, May 16 - Panama canal - Balboa - Backlog of vesselss gradually being reduced and the queue awaiting transit (total for balboa and cristobal) as of 0001 was now 69 vessels (actual).</p>
<p>May 17 - As of 0001, 63 vessels (estimated).</p>
<p>May 18 - As of 0001, 61 vessels (estimated).</p>
</text>
